sections.text:
[[Die Ausdauer]] is endurance: what English calls cardio. Running, cycling, swimming, the treadmill at the gym and the stairs at the U-Bahn station all count.

This lesson gives you:
- the words for these sports and for how a run feels;
- the numbers above 100, so you can say your heart rate ([[der Puls]]);
- a short scene at a [[Lauftreff]], a group that meets regularly to run together.
